{"articleNo":"445761","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=445761&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [선발공고]2023-2학기 생활관생 선발 공고(재학생, 복학생, 대학원신입생)(정정: 관 배정 기준)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.06.22","hit":"10060","attachments":[{"name":"(공지용)2023-2학기 생활관생 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=445761&attachNo=126177"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt;\">학기 생활관생 선발 공고를 안내합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">상세사항은 첨부파일을 반드시 읽어보시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"></p><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">※ 수업연한초과자는</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">개관(2023.8.26.)이후 매주 월요일 시행하는 추가선발</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">에</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">생활관 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">우선/일반/개관 전 추가선발에 신청하실 경우, 탈락처리됩니다.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">특히 추가선발은 학기 당 1회 신청가능하므로&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">꼭 개관 이후 추가선발에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">자세한 사항은 생활관 홈페이지 내 선발공고문을 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ※ 오름관3동 기혼자실은 2024학년도 1학기부터 남학생이 배정될 예정입니다.</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;※ 정정: (18페이지, 관 배정 기준) 푸름관1,2동 일반실(2인실) →&nbsp;</span><o:p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"></o:p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">푸름관1,2동 일반실(1</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">인실)</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(243, 197, 52); background-color: rgb(254, 254, 184);\"><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">FAQ</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 또는 하계방학에 거주하던 호실이 달라지나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ 네,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호실을 재배정합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공고문에 나온 신청 기간 말고는 신청을 못하나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">네</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청기간 외에는 신청이 불가합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발 결과는 언제 확인할 수 있나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청하신 선발의 등록기간에 확인 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">         </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기혼자실 연장 신청 결과 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발 등록기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(7.18.~7.19. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">매일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">10:00 ~ 16:00)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 확인가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일반선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가선발 중 저는 어느 관에 신청할 수 있나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공고문의 마지막 페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(18p)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에서 대상에 따라 우선</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일반선발에 신청가능 관을 확인하실 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가선발때는 모든 관에 신청 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자세한 사항은 첨부파일의 공고문 8페이지를 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 054-478-7943</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생활관비 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 7201, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관비 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2·3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동 공공요금 예치금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아름관 시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고장 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 7944</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관 시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고장 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">각 관 운영사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(070-8786-5001), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2·3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(054-462-3032)</span></p></div><p class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(193, 193, 193); background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">교육부 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">방역지침</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">에 따라 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">생활관 운영이 변경</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">될 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; 배정된 관 및 호실 등이 변경될 수 있음을 생활관 신청 전 반드시 숙지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">선발일정 외 생활관 신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">등록기간에 생활관비를 미납 시 별도 통보 없이 자동 탈락 처리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">예외 처리 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><u><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">결핵진단서</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">미제출자</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">, </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">서류 유효기간 경과자 입사 불가능</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">하계방학 결핵진단서 제출자는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">추가제출 필요없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">운영하는 관 내 코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">일시적관찰실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">코로나 검사 결과 대기장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">운영 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">자가격리자</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">는 필히 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">본가 귀가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">교내 및 생활관에서 자가격리 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">병원 검사결과 양성인 학생은 생활관 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">행정실로 반드시 신고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(054-478-4943)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">미신고로 인한 코로나 확산 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">벌점 부과 및 퇴사 조치 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">벌점기준표 나유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-15</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">항목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">호실 내 집합금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">본인 호실에 본인 및 룸메이트 외 출입금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">위반시 벌점부과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">벌점 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">점 초과 시 </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">퇴사 조치</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">예외불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 12.9pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">해충방역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">일반방역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">월 실시 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"26289\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 12.9pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">대학원생